# Email verification flow tests

### Create user (inactive, sends verification email)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/users
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "username": "ranishot",
    "password": "09290824",
    "email": "ranishot@hotmail.com"
}

###

### Resend verification email (public, rate-limited)
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/verify/email/send
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "email": "ranishot@hotmail.com"
}

###

### Verify email with token received in the email
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/verify/email
Content-Type: application/json
Accept: application/json

{
    "token": "eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiI2IiwiZW1haWwiOiJyYW5pc2hvdEBob3RtYWlsLmNvbSIsInR5cGUiOiJlbWFpbF92ZXJpZmljYXRpb24iLCJleHAiOjE3ODczNjE1Njh9.Fx4wTn03W1Y453Ou3JTcJgeBsx8GxVlVyCT8rPBoBV0"
}

###

### Login blocked until email is verified
POST http://127.0.0.1:8000/api/auth/token
Content-Type: application/x-www-form-urlencoded
Accept: application/json

username=ranishot&password=09290824

###
